  "title": "Picadillo (Cuban Beef Hash)",
  "description": "I got the original recipe from my father-in-law and made a few changes. It has been one of my family&#39;s favorites for over 20 years. Serve over white rice, or complete with a side of French fries. It may not sound fancy but it is definitely delicious!",
